{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "epn8n-http",
  "title": "n8n / Webhooks, Forms and API",
  "tags": [
    "n8n"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "weekStart": "",
  "links": [],
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Data source",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {
          "text": "Prometheus",
          "value": "prometheus"
        },
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "job",
        "label": "Job",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(up, job)",
        "current": {
          "text": "n8n",
          "value": "n8n"
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false,
        "sort": 1,
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "instance",
        "label": "Instance",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(up{job=\"$job\"}, instance)",
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "sort": 1,
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "What this dashboard needs",
      "description": "Lists the n8n metric flags the panels below depend on.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Flags needed beyond `N8N_METRICS=true`: `N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_WEBHOOK_METRICS`, `N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_FORM_METRICS`, `N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_API_ENDPOINTS` (all =true). The API route/method/status breakdowns also need the matching `*_LABEL` flags.\n\nWebhook and form metrics need n8n >= 2.28. `scripts/doctor.sh` reports what your instance has."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Time since last request",
      "description": "Age of the most recent backend request, as time() minus n8n_last_activity. A value that keeps climbing means nothing is calling this instance any more. Needs N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_API_ENDPOINTS=true. The maximum over the selected instances is used, so this shows the freshest instance.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 3600
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 86400
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "time() - max(n8n_last_activity{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\"})",
          "legendFormat": "last request",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Webhook requests",
      "description": "Webhook requests per second over the last 5 minutes, counted from the _count series of the webhook latency histogram. Needs N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_WEBHOOK_METRICS=true and n8n 2.28 or newer.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 9
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(n8n_webhook_request_duration_seconds_count{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "requests",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Webhook error ratio",
      "description": "Share of webhook requests whose status code is not 2xx, over the last 5 minutes. The denominator is wrapped in clamp_min so an idle instance reads 0 instead of NaN. Needs N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_WEBHOOK_METRICS=true.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 9
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.05
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "(sum(rate(n8n_webhook_request_duration_seconds_count{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\", status_code!~\"2..\"}[5m])) or vector(0)) / clamp_min(sum(rate(n8n_webhook_request_duration_seconds_count{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m])), 0.000001)",
          "legendFormat": "error ratio",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Webhook latency p95",
      "description": "95th percentile webhook latency over the last 5 minutes. The webhook histogram has only the buckets 0.003, 0.03, 0.1, 0.3, 1.5 and 10 seconds, so any percentile that lands above 1.5s is interpolated across a very wide bucket and a percentile above 10s cannot be expressed at all. Needs N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_WEBHOOK_METRICS=true.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 9
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 3,
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.3
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1.5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(n8n_webhook_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Webhook request rate by status code",
      "description": "Webhook requests per second split by HTTP status code. A rising 4xx series usually means callers are sending bad payloads, a rising 5xx series means the workflow behind the webhook is failing. Needs N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_WEBHOOK_METRICS=true and n8n 2.28 or newer.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (status_code) (rate(n8n_webhook_request_duration_seconds_count{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status_code}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Webhook latency percentiles",
      "description": "p50, p95 and p99 webhook latency. The webhook histogram uses the coarse buckets 0.003, 0.03, 0.1, 0.3, 1.5 and 10 seconds. Percentiles falling between 1.5s and 10s are interpolated across that single wide bucket and are therefore rough, and anything slower than the 10s bucket is reported as 10s. Treat the high percentiles as an order of magnitude, not a measurement. Needs N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_WEBHOOK_METRICS=true.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 13
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(n8n_webhook_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(n8n_webhook_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(n8n_webhook_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(n8n_webhook_request_duration_seconds_sum{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(n8n_webhook_request_duration_seconds_count{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m])), 0.000001)",
          "legendFormat": "mean",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Webhook error ratio over time",
      "description": "Non-2xx webhook responses divided by all webhook responses. The denominator uses clamp_min so periods with no traffic read 0 rather than NaN. The status_code label is part of the webhook metric itself and does not depend on the API label flags. Needs N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_WEBHOOK_METRICS=true.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "(sum(rate(n8n_webhook_request_duration_seconds_count{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\", status_code!~\"2..\"}[5m])) or vector(0)) / clamp_min(sum(rate(n8n_webhook_request_duration_seconds_count{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m])), 0.000001)",
          "legendFormat": "non-2xx share",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Slowest webhook paths (p95)",
      "description": "The ten webhook paths with the highest 95th percentile latency over the last 5 minutes. Because the histogram buckets are coarse, several paths often share the same interpolated value; use this to find candidates, then confirm with the request rate panel. Needs N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_WEBHOOK_METRICS=true.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 21
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 3,
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false,
          "reducer": [
            "sum"
          ],
          "countRows": false,
          "fields": ""
        },
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "p95",
            "desc": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "topk(10, histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, webhook_path) (rate(n8n_webhook_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m]))))",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "indexByName": {},
            "renameByName": {
              "webhook_path": "Webhook path",
              "Value": "p95"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Form submission rate by status code",
      "description": "n8n form submissions per second split by HTTP status code, from the _count series of the form latency histogram. Needs N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_FORM_METRICS=true and n8n 2.28 or newer.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 29
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (status_code) (rate(n8n_form_submission_duration_seconds_count{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status_code}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Form submission latency",
      "description": "p50, p95 and p99 latency of n8n form submissions. The form histogram shares the coarse webhook buckets 0.003, 0.03, 0.1, 0.3, 1.5 and 10 seconds, so percentiles above 1.5s are interpolated across one wide bucket and are approximate. Needs N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_FORM_METRICS=true.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 29
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(n8n_form_submission_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(n8n_form_submission_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(n8n_form_submission_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"$job\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "API request rate by route",
      "description": "Requests per second against the n8n backend routes, from the express instrumentation. Needs N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_API_ENDPOINTS=true, and N8N_METRICS_INCLUDE_API_PATH_LABEL=true for the per-route split. Without the path label every request collapses into one series.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 37
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
